      ],
      "source": "https://onlyinark.com/places-and-travel/discover-camden-history-charm-and-catfish/"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The 1913 train depot, now the Camden Visitor Center & Museum, displays Camark Pottery, Grapette drinks, and railroad lore.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        18
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
